check 1
# A missile kill: the Amazon's Fire Arrow on a Quill Rat in the Blood Moor
# (warp 2 at frame 4; town allows no combat). The Quill Rat (monstats 63,
# normal) is poked at @x+4 @y+4 at frame 30 and stays there (recorded
# 1.14d position = player + (4, 4) through frame 62, combat-arrow-quillrat).
# Fire Arrows (missiles row 12, skill 7 level 20, owner the player) aimed
# at that cell every 8 frames from frame 34. ScnAma has no bow: a plain
# arrow's damage comes from the owner's weapon (missiles/damage.md §1,
# SrcDamage) and did 0 on both sides; Fire Arrow's fire damage comes from
# the skill (EMin/EMax by level). Compare the rat's life and death and the
# player's.
name combat-arrow-kill
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 110
seconds 300
channels state
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 63 @x+4 @y+4 normal
at 34 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 42 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 50 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 58 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 66 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
